{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22466","headline":"东坡种花二首 二 · 白居易","name":"东坡种花二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东坡春向暮，树木今何如。\n漠漠花落尽，翳翳叶生初。\n每日领童仆，荷鉏仍决渠。\n剗土壅其本，引泉溉其枯。\n小树低数尺，大树长丈余。\n封植来几时，高下随扶疎。\n养树既如此，养民亦何殊。\n将欲茂枝叶，必先救根株。\n云何救根株，劝农均赋租。\n云何茂枝叶，省事宽刑书。\n移此爲郡政，庶几甿俗苏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22466.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22466","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}